      <Capitolo>System information</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;BR/&gt; The electronic parking brake, which can be activated by pressing a button, has the ability to keep the car stationary and safe even when the engine is off or there is no power supply. &lt;BR/&gt; It is activated automatically when the engine is switched off and deactivated when the vehicle starts to move. &lt;BR/&gt; In the event of a flat battery or mechanical failure, the &lt;B&gt; parking brake may not disengage &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt; </Corpo>
